  <item>
    <title>03 运动带给我们的：与自我连接，也探索世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a7dec3f4ccb12e0b4cfed0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a7dec3f4ccb12e0b4cfed0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 07 Jul 2023 09:45:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们聊了运动的话题，由擅长组的朋友分享了自己如何在运动中感受到与自我的联结，也有不擅长组的朋友讲述自己从糟糕的初始体验中慢慢摸索与成长的过程。我们也聊了关于文化对女性身体的种种限制、很多不必要的慢性疼痛其实也可以通过运动复健、DCD对于不擅长儿童的影响等相关话题，欢迎你来收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：慧艳</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：慧艳</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期共同聊天的是：余晶颖、怡伶、汐羽、可心</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目中提到的DCD相关内容，参考“</span><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span>青衫Aspie</span></a><span>”公众号。</span></p><span></span><p><span>shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a> &nbsp;主播们最近都在沉迷什么运动</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">07:56</a> &nbsp;运动中的“个人化”体验</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;DCD（发育性协调障碍）是什么？与DCD共处是一种什么感觉？</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> &nbsp;作为女性，社会文化如何影响我们与运动和身体的关系</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1844">30:44</a> 运动是不是成了一套对现代人的新的规训方式？</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1998">33:18</a> &nbsp;汐羽最近在看的综艺《海妖的呼唤》带来的感受</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2173">36:13</a> &nbsp;带着思考去运动以及如何选择一个好教练 &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> &nbsp;主播们是如何开始运动的</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2811">46:51</a> &nbsp;作为女性，我们都可能经历哪些身体损伤以及产后康复的体验</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3137">52:17</a> &nbsp;开启运动并不容易！一旦开启又感到停不下来！</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> &nbsp;运动与生活的爱恨情仇</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3394">56:34</a> 随着运动一起不断变化的体验与视角</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie" data-url="https://www.zhihu.com/people/QingshanAspie"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3579">59:39</a> 一起来尝试新运动吧！</span></a></p>]]></description>
